# MaterialMenu: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_MaterialMenu.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ptr glide 18 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot system-menu
note Material: grouped rows (40 px), surface pills
key -k Escape
note the space menu (right-click a chip by hand) is plain 28 px rows, centred, scaling 0.94 to 1
